orecast lands at a modest Republican lead with elevated uncertainty, given how sparse and dated the polling is.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.1914, "margin": -5.2}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.2771, "margin": -4.5}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.2238, "margin": -5.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.2476, "margin": -5.0}]}